WEBVTT

00:00:00.619 --> 00:00:04.954
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> Now, children. Sarah is your babysitter.

00:00:05.455 --> 00:00:06.321
Be good.

00:00:08.871 --> 00:00:09.987
<v><b>Children:</b></v> OK, Mum.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.586
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> Goodbye, Sarah.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.786
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Bye, Mrs Taylor.

00:00:20.929 --> 00:00:25.726
OK, let’s order pizza and watch TV.

00:00:26.291 --> 00:00:30.574
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> My mother says no pizza and no TV.

00:00:30.937 --> 00:00:34.717
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Well, your mother isn’t here, is she?